# GMS's barrier blocks status conditions and recharges; what survives here is
# the passive half printed under it. GMS reaches 40 of each at its ten levels;
# this walks the same ceiling over twenty, two a level.
#
# Both levers are dead by design -- nothing inflicts a status or carries an
# element -- and are here so the stats page can show what the SP bought.
#
# Nothing here reaches the party. GMS's only party clause is a cooldown Dispel
# shortens, and the resistances are stated for the caster alone.
name: "Divine Protection"
description: "Permanently increases Status Resistance and Elemental Resistance."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PRIEST skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 20
base {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
}
per_level {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
}
